#OBJECTS
#8300
sign notice~
Frost Valley sign~
An important notice is nailed to a sign here.
~
~
13 93060752 0
0 0 0 0
10000 0 0
E
sign notice~
You are now entering:

==================================================================
:                          VALLEY                                :
:                            OF THE                              :
:                              FROST                             :
==================================================================

++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
+                            NOTICE:                             +
+                                                                +
+     This is not an area for the weak. Be warned,               +
+     it would not be advisable to venture any further           +
+     down this path until AT LEAST level 40. Do not             +
+     tempt the reaper for he may come calling.                  +
+                                                                +
++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++


Below this you see:

/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
/                     WANTED: DEAD OR ALIVE                     /
/                                                               /
/       Taz the Slasher: HEIGHT: 4"2'                           /
/                        WEIGHT: approx: 210 lbs                /
/                        AGE: 46                                /
/                        CHARACTERISTICS: Large bearded Dwarf,  /
/                        large scar over left eye.              /
/                                                               /
/                                                               /
/     Beware, The Slasher is wanted for the murder of 7 young   /
/     elves.  He is extremely dangerous. Take extreme caution   /
/     if you see this individual.                               /
/                                                               /
/     Your reward will be whatever objects this criminal        /
/     has in his inventory. He's stolen from many, many people. /
/                                                               /
/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
~
